div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">SKY Sprint 15 Km (SKY15)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 600m D+ \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 3 horas<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e reservat\u00f3rio pr\u00f3prio para l\u00edquidos (Controlo Zero \u00e0s 09:15)<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23 a 25\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26 a 31\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01 a 08\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Vila de Nisa (CVN) 12 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 300m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23 a 25\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26 a 31\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01 a 08\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o I Skyrunning Vila de Nisa 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O I Skyrunning Vila de Nisa realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, no centro de Nisa (distrito de Portalegre). O secretariado funciona na Biblioteca Municipal de Nisa no s\u00e1bado (14 de novembro, das 17:00 \u00e0s 22:00) e no domingo (das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O SKY Race 30 km (1450 m D+, tempo limite de 7 horas) parte \u00e0s 09:00 com controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45; o SKY Sprint 15 km (600 m D+, tempo limite de 3 horas) parte \u00e0s 09:30 com controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15; e a Caminhada Vila de Nisa de 12 km (300 m D+) inicia-se \u00e0s 09:35.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 8 de novembro (limitadas a 400 vagas) em 3 fases: no SKY30 custam 16,00 \u20ac (23 a 25\/10), 17,50 \u20ac (26 a 31\/10) e 19,00 \u20ac (1 a 8\/11); no SKY15 custam 15,00 \u20ac, 16,50 \u20ac e 18,00 \u20ac; e na Caminhada custam 14,00 \u20ac, 15,50 \u20ac e 17,00 \u20ac. S\u00f3cios da Inijovem beneficiam de 2,00 \u20ac de desconto e o almo\u00e7o opcional tem o valor de 6,00 \u20ac para participantes (8,00 \u20ac para acompanhantes).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pelo regulamento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito e manta t\u00e9rmica (a falta de qualquer item implica penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o de 30 minutos). Como n\u00e3o s\u00e3o distribu\u00eddos copos nem garrafas nos abastecimentos, cada participante deve levar o seu pr\u00f3prio reservat\u00f3rio ou copo reutiliz\u00e1vel.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que circuitos oficiais e servi\u00e7os integram a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Organizado pela Inijovem e pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nisa, o SKY30 integra o Campeonato Centro-Sul da FCMP e o SKY15 integra o Trof\u00e9u Nacional de SkySprint. O evento disponibiliza banhos, dormida em solo duro, pr\u00e9mio finisher e servi\u00e7o gratuito de babysitting para filhos dos participantes.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"I Skyrunning Vila de Nisa 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Nisa, Portalegre\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Nisa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Portalegre\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O I Skyrunning Vila de Nisa 2026 realiza-se a 15 de novembro em Nisa. Provas de 30 km (1450m D+), 15 km e caminhada de 12 km. Regulamento e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-skyrunning-vila-de-nisa.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"SKY Race 30 Km (SKY30)\", \"price\": \"19.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/i-skyrunning-vila-de-nisa\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"SKY Sprint 15 Km (SKY15)\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/i-skyrunning-vila-de-nisa\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Vila de Nisa (CVN) 12 Km\", \"price\": \"17.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/i-skyrunning-vila-de-nisa\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Inijovem e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nisa\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"